! name: Apis News
! description: News without the corporate-media filter, by Apis
! public: true
! author: Apis
! avatar: #fcea7e

! Removes corporate and partisan propaganda outlets. Boosts independent and primary-source
! reporting, including regional sources on the Middle East.
!
! Ratings are added by the Goggle Rater app. Keep the section headers below intact.

